      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners commend the veterinary staff, veterinary technicians, and reception team on Fraser Street for their warm and welcoming attitude. Clients appreciate that veterinarians listen carefully, explain diagnoses without rushing, and take time to answer questions. Reviewers note that the team creates a comfortable environment during medical appointments."
