      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle approach for fearful pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Multiple clients highlight how well the hospital staff manage fearful, anxious, or reactive pets. Owners of nervous dogs and sensitive cats note that veterinarians offer treats, use calm body language, and avoid intimidating techniques during examinations. Reviewers appreciate that pets who typically fear clinic visits remain relaxed and settled here."
      }
    },
