        "en": "Most reviewers report excellent clinical outcomes, praising successful surgeries, straightforward checkups, and diagnostic testing for complex feline illnesses. Dog owners also commend smooth post-operative recoveries following anesthesia. However, one client felt disappointed when an ear infection remained unresolved despite significant clinic costs."
      }
